meta {
  name: saveTradeItemPrice
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveTradeItemPrice",
    "params": {
      "trade_item_id": 456,
      "price_list_id": 1,
      "price_start_date": "2025-01-01",
      "gross_price": 49.95,
      "price_base": 1,
      "price_base_uom": "PCE"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Create or update a price entry for a trade item in a price list

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `trade_item_price_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the price entry; omit to create a new price |
  | `external_trade_item_price_id` | string (nullable) | no | Your system's reference ID for the price entry |
  | `price_list_id` | integer (nullable) | no | ID of the price list this price belongs to |
  | `trade_item_id` | integer (nullable) | no | ID of the trade item |
  | `price_start_date` | string (nullable) | no | Date from which this price is effective (ISO 8601) |
  | `gross_price` | number (nullable) | no | Gross (list) price |
  | `net_price` | number (nullable) | no | Net price after standard discounts |
  | `suggested_price` | number (nullable) | no | Suggested retail price |
  | `price_base` | number (nullable) | no | Quantity base for which the price applies |
  | `price_base_uom` | string (nullable) | no | Unit of measurement for the price base |
  | `price_on_request` | boolean (nullable) | no | True if the price is available on request only |
  | `expires_in_days` | integer (nullable) | no | Number of days until this price expires (0-65535) |

  **Example: Set a trade item price**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveTradeItemPrice",
    "params": {
      "trade_item_id": 456,
      "price_list_id": 1,
      "price_start_date": "2025-01-01",
      "gross_price": 49.95,
      "price_base": 1,
      "price_base_uom": "PCE"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "trade_item_price_id": 789
  }
  ```
}
